   "cooked": "<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#retroactive-funding-for-tec-at-eth-denver-2022-1\" name=\"retroactive-funding-for-tec-at-eth-denver-2022-1\"></a><strong>Retroactive Funding for TEC at ETH Denver 2022</strong>\n</h3>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tldr-2\" name=\"tldr-2\"></a>TL;DR</h3>\n<p>Hey everyone! This retroactive funding proposal is on behalf of the people who represented TEC at ETH Denver 2022.</p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#proposal-description-3\" name=\"proposal-description-3\"></a>Proposal description</h3>\n<p>The expenses below were reimbursed by Griff in xDAI. The total amount requested would be sent to Griff’s address.</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Expense</th>\n<th>Paid by</th>\n<th>Amount</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Accommodation for 1 person in the ETHDenver Stack House</td>\n<td>Griff</td>\n<td>553.16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flights</td>\n<td>Chuy</td>\n<td>330</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://twitter.com/AnaTech_/status/1494340353930891271\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">TEC/TEA pins</a></td>\n<td>AnaTech</td>\n<td>82</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td><strong>965.16</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#how-does-this-proposal-benefit-the-community-andor-the-field-of-token-engineering-4\" name=\"how-does-this-proposal-benefit-the-community-andor-the-field-of-token-engineering-4\"></a>How does this proposal benefit the community and/or the field of Token Engineering?</h3>\n<p>As <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/tec-funding-proposals-what-kinds-of-projects-should-apply/191\">stated in this post</a>, TEC Outreach is something that may qualify for funding. Several members of the TEC were able to go to Denver and represent the TEC, most were able to have their trip covered by Giveth, General Magic, or Commons Stack, but these costs were hard to justify for those orgs so we are requesting the reimbursement from the TEC.</p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#additional-information-to-add-5\" name=\"additional-information-to-add-5\"></a>Additional information to add</h3>\n<p>Here are some of the talks given by our community members during ETH Denver 2022 - <a href=\"https://twitter.com/tecmns/status/1496137714785308677\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">DAO Check: Getting Stewardship Right</a>, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/tecmns/status/1496507641865981953\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Cultural Build: A Framework for Self-Actualizing Economies</a>, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/tecmns/status/1496875062913384451\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Biggest Web3 Opportunity That No One is Talking About</a>.<br/>\nThere was a <a href=\"https://twitter.com/tecmns/status/1494436933681958929\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">TEC/TEA POAP</a> too!</p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#amount-requested-only-for-conviction-voting-6\" name=\"amount-requested-only-for-conviction-voting-6\"></a>Amount requested (Only for Conviction Voting)</h3>\n<p>965.16 wxDAI</p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#team-information-7\" name=\"team-information-7\"></a>Team Information</h3>\n<p>Griff, Chuy and AnaTech</p>",
