   "cooked": "<p>We’d like to get soft consensus here before we add a vote in the TEC gardens <img alt=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/slight_smile.png?v=10\" title=\":slight_smile:\"/></p>\n<div class=\"poll\" data-poll-charttype=\"bar\" data-poll-name=\"poll\" data-poll-results=\"always\" data-poll-status=\"open\" data-poll-type=\"regular\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"poll-container\">\n<ul>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"eb4c0dd160ada8c20cd7380865ec7d89\">I support this proposal</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"6e5dbdf349fe75f8d38648d40de7e6c9\">I don’t support this</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"poll-info\">\n<p>\n<span class=\"info-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"info-label\">voters</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
